# Plant watering schedule

| Plant | Where | Summer | Winter | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Monstera | living room | weekly | every 10–12 days | check top 3 cm |
| Snake plant | bookshelf | every 14 days | monthly | let it dry fully |
| Pothos | kitchen | every 5–7 days | weekly | droops when thirsty |
| Aloe vera | balcony | every 2–3 weeks | monthly | gritty soil |
| Tulsi | balcony | daily in heat | every 2–3 days | pinch the flowers |
| Money plant cutting | jar | top up water weekly | same | change water monthly |

Going away? Group the pots in the bathroom and ask Hira to check the tulsi.
